<title>SWEDEN: Ave rate 4.10 pct on Swedish seven day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Ave rate 4.10 pct on Swedish seven day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an auction of 35 billion crowns worth of seven day Treasury bills was 4.10 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The lowest rate was 4.085 percent, the highest accepted rate was 4.100 percent and the weighted average rate 4.095 percent, the office said.</p>
<p>It said 100 percent of the paper was served at the highest rate. The paper runs from April 30 to May 7.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
